WEBVTT

00:18:57.876 --> 00:19:00.996
than maybe folks of my age?

00:19:01.556 --> 00:19:05.196
Or is that just,
I don't know, an urban myth?

00:19:05.236 --> 00:19:06.476
LG: Yeah, it's myth.

00:19:06.476 --> 00:19:09.516
This idea that like, oh,
you only use 10 percent of your brain

00:19:09.516 --> 00:19:11.556
or you only use
five percent of your brain,

00:19:11.596 --> 00:19:13.396
someone's making it smaller.

00:19:13.716 --> 00:19:15.796
I don't know who started that one, either.

00:19:15.836 --> 00:19:16.956
That's not true.

00:19:16.996 --> 00:19:18.916
So, you know, at any given moment,

00:19:18.956 --> 00:19:21.396
I'm using certain parts
of my brain, right?

00:19:21.436 --> 00:19:24.116
So I'm not in a rage right now,

00:19:24.116 --> 00:19:26.476
so my amygdala is kind of chilling.

00:19:26.516 --> 00:19:28.276
Like, I'm not grief-stricken,

00:19:28.316 --> 00:19:30.436
so my amygdala is kind of relaxed,